## Hard Rules

- Emit exactly one `sections` entry per audio section with exact IDs and timestamps.
- Use only supplied theme, palette, motif, and typed-target IDs.
- Keep section ThemeRef scope at SECTION and tags within the schema limit.
- `palette_arc` is ordered, has unique stop IDs, and begins at the first section.
- `PaletteRoleRef.override` is a required nullable field. Null inherits the active stop.
- `motif_continuity` has unique motif IDs and valid unique section references.
- Each section has exactly one unique LEAD target; `focal_arc` repeats that typed target.
- Any call-and-response pair uses two different resolvable targets.
- Do not output effect names, assets, filenames, exact placement timing, or DMX values.

